&lt;li&gt;Resolving maintenance issues in the area of HVAC, electrical, plumbing and appliance repair&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing vacant apartments for move-in through turn-over repairs and improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preserving the beauty of the building and the safety of the community through general upkeep and cleanliness, snow removal and grounds maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing residents with outstanding customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working weekends or evenings and being on call for after hour emergencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;What You Bring to Us:&lt;/h1&gt;
